ChorusDraft Elixir version — unreleased
Modification notice — September 6, 2026

This branch contains the Linux Elixir implementation of ChorusDraft with support
for Bluesky and Mastodon. It derives its feature set from ChorusDraft 0.51.1 and
is developed separately on the elixir-experimental branch. The Ruby branches are
retained separately and are not modified by this implementation.

ChorusDraft was authored by Buntatoes and is distributed under the GNU General
Public License version 3. The Elixir implementation remains under GPLv3. See
LICENSE for the complete terms and elixir/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for dependency
notices.

